er Effects. Qala kwakhona After Effects kwaye uzame kwakhona. Iinkcukacha:","Flex ayikwazanga ukuguqula le vector ukuya SVG. Zama ukuyincamathisela njenge PNG endaweni yoko. Iinkcukacha:","Flex ayikwazanga kuvula umfanekiso webhodi eqhotyoshwayo. Isenokuba kwifomati Flex ayixhasi - zama ukuyikhuphela njenge PNG.","Flex ayikwazanga ukuqhubeka nomfanekiso webhodi eqhotyoshwayo. Khuphela kwakhona, uze uncamathisele. Iinkcukacha:","Flex ayikwazanga ukufunda indlela yefayile kwibhodi eqhotyoshwayo. Khuphela ifayile kwakhona, uze uncamathisele.","Flex akakwazanga ukufunda umfanekiso kwibhodi eqhotyoshwayo. Khuphela kwakhona, uze uncamathisele.","Flex ayikwazanga ukugcina iVector eguquliweyo. Khangela ukuba unendawo yedisk esimahla kunye nemvume yokubhalela kolu lawulo. Iinkcukacha:","Flex ayikwazanga kugcina umfanekiso oncamathisiweyo. Khangela ukuba unendawo yedisk esimahla kunye nemvume yokubhalela kolu lawulo. Iinkcukacha:","Flex ayikwazanga ukuguqula umfanekiso webhodi eqhotyoshwayo ube yifayile. Khuphela kwakhona, uze uncamathisele.","Flex ayikwazanga ukusebenza ukuba ungagcina phi umfanekiso oncamathisiweyo. Gcina iprojekthi yakho, uze uzame kwakhona.","Flex ayikwazanga ukusebenza ukuba ungagcina phi umfanekiso oncamathisiweyo. Gcina iprojekthi yakho, uze uzame kwakhona. Iinkcukacha:","Flex yeyona igqwesileyo...","Flex ilahlekelwe ngumdibaniso wayo kwi After Effects. Vala indawo yolawulo kwaye uyivule kwakhona, okanye uqalise kwakhona After Effects.","Flex idinga iprojekthi evuliweyo phambi kokuba incamathelise. Vula okanye wenze iprojekthi, uze uzame kwakhona.","Flex ufuna ukuthetha Into","I-FlexPack ayinanto.","Flip Horizontal ngeSikali -X","Jikelezisa ngokuthe nkqo ngeSikali -Y","Ukuqukuqela nokuNciphisa","Imo yomhleli oqukuqelayo","Igama lesiqulathi seefayili alinakuqulatha iisilayi.","Igama lesiqulathi seefayili...","Isiqulathi seefayili sikhethwe ngempumelelo!","Landela","Ifonti","Usapho lwefonti","ifonti yoMmiseleli","Ifolda yefonti ayifunyenwanga","Ifonti if